# Build marker, not the script. scripts/materialize-role-scripts.sh copies the source named
# below to files/Get-LapsCredential.ps1 before the role is linted or run; that copy is a build
# artifact the .gitignore deliberately never allowlists.
#
# The script is developed, reviewed and pair-tested once under scripts/, beside its
# Get-LapsCredential.pester.ps1 spec. Its whole reason to exist is the distinction the 'until'
# loop depends on: a credential that has not been escrowed YET is a state to wait on, while an
# identity the directory does not know is a failure no amount of waiting fixes.
scripts/Get-LapsCredential.ps1
